# Deterministic line endings: Python sources are LF both in the index and on
# disk, on every platform. Fixes the recorded v4-baseline CRLF checkout drift
# (frozen cohort ledger hashes LF-normalized content; core.autocrlf=true
# materialized CRLF on disk, failing the hash-bound cohort tests).
*.py text eol=lf
.gitattributes text eol=lf
